silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_06_unit_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'UnitLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Unit_grams: the SI gram unit node (symbol: g, dimension: mass, UCUM code: g); used as the unit-attribution source for WeightMeas_3450g; shared by any gram-valued measurement in the local olog; also, UnitArrow_grams: the composed arrow Unit_grams -> WeightMeas_3450g -> MittensColimitApex; the unit leg routes through the measurement event; also, SI_MassUnit: the SI international system mass unit type; the authority node that types Unit_grams as a gram unit; the BIPM SI definition." .
